WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.310
- We love being able to
end the show with something

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:03.240
extra positive.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.269
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:04.269 --> 00:00:07.620
♪ Upbeat music ♪

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:10.290
It's no secret I don't
keep up on much sports ball

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:11.760
but I will never deny that sports

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:13.680
can really bring people together.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.320
Just look at this beautiful
video of a young boy

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.181
and his grandpa.

00:00:17.181 --> 00:00:19.140
- [Grandpa] What did you do?

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.687
- So, you know, I got
two home runs, right?

00:00:21.687 --> 00:00:23.520
- You got two, Jack.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.650
- And then my grand slam.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.662
I signed the ball for you.

00:00:27.662 --> 00:00:29.132
- Okay.

00:00:29.132 --> 00:00:30.470
- Is it dated?

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:31.303
- And it says

00:00:31.303 --> 00:00:32.370
- No

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:34.590
- I'll put the date on it for you.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.213
- And it says, Papa, I love you.

00:00:38.574 --> 00:00:39.960
- (voice cracking) Why did you do that?

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.854
- Because you taught me
everything about baseball.

00:00:42.854 --> 00:00:43.725
- Oh, honey.

00:00:43.725 --> 00:00:45.435
That's so sweet.

00:00:45.435 --> 00:00:47.974
I'll put it on my, I'll
put it right on my-

00:00:47.974 --> 00:00:50.340
Oh God, that was so good.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:52.473
Wow, honey. Woo!

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.290
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:58.140
If you're not crying right
now, there's something wrong

00:00:58.140 --> 00:00:59.790
with your cold dead heart.

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.950
That is like the most
beautiful thing ever.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:05.310
We have that young athlete on
the line along with his papa.

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:09.273
Let's say hi to Felix and
Bruce watching on KSFYF4.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:11.093
Hi y'all.

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.190
How are y'all doing?

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.858
- (both) Hello.

00:01:15.858 --> 00:01:16.920
It's so nice to meet you.

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:18.060
- [Kelly] Nice to meet you as well.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:19.980
Oh my gosh, you're such
a beautiful young man.

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:22.320
So you, Bruce, you were clearly so touched

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:24.480
by Felix giving you one of his game balls.

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.120
That was amazing to watch.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.473
- Yes. That was a special, special day.

00:01:31.590 --> 00:01:33.240
I mean, he had such a great day.

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:36.090
Hits two home runs inside the park.

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:41.090
And still thinks about his
papa, comes over the house

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.890
gives me a ball, says, Papa, I love you.

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:47.168
Now, it doesn't get much
better than that, Kelly.

00:01:47.168 --> 00:01:48.690
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:50.070
Yeah, you are,

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.080
your family is so beautiful.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:56.069
Felix, your Papa's the one who
got you into baseball, right?

00:01:56.069 --> 00:02:00.360
- Yeah. When I was three, I
started playing catch with him,

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:03.930
and then when I was four
I started playing T-ball,

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.250
which was fun,

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.610
and ever since then I've
been playing baseball

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.550
and now I'm on a traveling team with it,

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:13.230
which is really cool.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:16.770
And my papa taught me how to pitch,

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:20.130
how to catch, how to catch pop flies.

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:22.260
And most importantly, he taught me

00:02:22.260 --> 00:02:26.580
that it doesn't matter if
you win, lose, strike out,

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.110
don't catch a pop fly,

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.850
it just matters if you have fun.

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:31.710
Oh, and Kelly, do you wanna hear a joke

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:32.940
that my papa taught me?

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:35.280
- Yes, I do, I definitely do.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:38.760
- How many home runs
has Kelly Clarkson hit?

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.860
- Oh, I don't know how many.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:43.080
- Every time you're on
stage, you hit a home run.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.435
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:02:44.435 --> 00:02:47.060
(audience cheering)

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:47.893
Oh my God,

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:49.833
you two.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:52.471
I'm just like- you-

00:02:52.471 --> 00:02:55.620
you have just made me feel so good.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:57.030
Just this interview alone.

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.590
You too have so much light about you.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:01.290
Thank you so much for sharing it with us.

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:04.860
Thank you Felix and Bruce, I'm
liking your post right now.

